-- Smash history: the sets of 2009's and 2010's Melee majors, read by hand from Liquipedia's bracket pages (round
-- 734's way; Matthew, 2026-11-22: "Continue"). Liquipedia keeps the later rounds of these brackets, not every set;
-- scores as it lists them (none where it only marks the winner); forfeits left out. Made with
-- tools/liquipedia/bracket-to-sql.mjs from tools/liquipedia/brackets/2009-2010-melee.txt. Safe to run twice.

-- manual/2010-revival-of-melee-3 (melee): 93 sets, from https://liquipedia.net/smash/Revival_of_Melee/3/Singles_Bracket
on conflict (set_id) do update set round = excluded.round, sort_order = excluded.sort_order, p1_name = excluded.p1_name,
  p1_score = excluded.p1_score, p2_name = excluded.p2_name, p2_score = excluded.p2_score, winner = excluded.winner;

